[
  {"comment": "SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT. A glue flap (mitcad#1939): on a 2 mm board sheet 100 x 60 (rules F1, sketch F2, Face F3), add_glue_flap on its right edge: the flange's profile sketch (its plane F4 and sketch F5, before the flange) made a trapezoid slanting in by 15 degrees at both ends, the flange F6 30 long with that profile."},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "sheet_rules", "process": "board", "thickness": 2, "bend_radius": 0.25,
